                                                "sense_id": "60315d4f-f3a9-3c10-a06a-c368abb4f8a4",
                                                "text": "Inscripturation is part of being human, or at least it has been for a long time. We inscribe words on bark, papyri, codices, human skin (tattoos), books, magazines, bracelets, and automobiles."
